\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces UF-4 win rates against the common base, with order averaging and ties worth $0.5$. Every entry is computed on the $1{,}719$ prompts of the planned $2{,}000$ for which \emph  {all} arms reported here have both presentation orders parsed on all four attributes, so the arms are compared on identical prompts; each method's own valid count is larger ($1{,}916$--$1{,}935$) and is reported in Appendix~\ref {app:evaluation} rather than used here. The common set shrinks as arms are added and is recomputed whenever a row is filled, so these numbers are tied to the set of rows present. $\min _k W_k$ is the minimum attribute mean. Only helpfulness has a whole-prompt bootstrap interval excluding $0.5$ for all five evaluated seeds; truthfulness excludes it for two of the three NBPO seeds, and instruction following, honesty and the minimum objective do not for any seed. Honesty sits at or just below $0.5$ for both families on this common set, and its utilitarian seed spread ($0.0139$) is an order of magnitude wider than the others. Dashes are unmeasured.}}{12}{table.63}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:uf-objectives}{{1}{12}{UF-4 win rates against the common base, with order averaging and ties worth $0.5$. Every entry is computed on the $1{,}719$ prompts of the planned $2{,}000$ for which \emph {all} arms reported here have both presentation orders parsed on all four attributes, so the arms are compared on identical prompts; each method's own valid count is larger ($1{,}916$--$1{,}935$) and is reported in Appendix~\ref {app:evaluation} rather than used here. The common set shrinks as arms are added and is recomputed whenever a row is filled, so these numbers are tied to the set of rows present. $\min _k W_k$ is the minimum attribute mean. Only helpfulness has a whole-prompt bootstrap interval excluding $0.5$ for all five evaluated seeds; truthfulness excludes it for two of the three NBPO seeds, and instruction following, honesty and the minimum objective do not for any seed. Honesty sits at or just below $0.5$ for both families on this common set, and its utilitarian seed spread ($0.0139$) is an order of magnitude wider than the others. Dashes are unmeasured}{table.63}{}}
